# Orthographic and collocation preferences for common conversion candidates.
# JapaneseKeyboard promotes candidates matching these scoreless rules after
# collecting its bounded N-best safety window.
"で" + "いう" + "と"
"いり" + "ます"
"インクジェット" + "紙"
# Prefer the trajectory sense in noun + の + 軌跡 phrases without making
# 軌跡 the global default for the ambiguous reading きせき.
pos("名詞") + "の" + "軌跡"
# The inflected verb is a separate conversion node in the system dictionary.
"軌跡" + "に" + "沿っ"
